{"unit_id":1,"stage_id":1,"lesson":{"lesson_id":1,"lesson_key":"S1L1","stage_id":1,"title":"Aasaan Qur'ani Alfaaz (Set 1 — Ma'rifah الْـ ki Pehchaan)","title_i18n":{"hinglish":"Aasaan Qur'ani Alfaaz (Set 1 — Ma'rifah الْـ ki Pehchaan)","en":"Easy Qur'anic Words (Set 1 — Definite Article Al- الْـ)","ur":"آسان قرآنی الفاظ (سیٹ ۱ — معرفہ الْـ کی پہچان)","hi":"आसान क़ुरआनी अल्फ़ाज़ (सेट 1 — मारिफ़ा الْـ की पहचान)"},"arabic_Focus":"إِسْلَامٌ ، قُرْآنٌ ، إِيمَانٌ ← الْإِسْلَامُ ، الْقُرْآنُ ، الْإِيمَانُ","hinglish_Focus":"Islam, Qur'an, Imaan → Al-Islam, Al-Qur'an, Al-Imaan (Khaas Ism)","page_numbers":"14–15","book_page":14,"sections":[{"id":"sec_hero","type":"hero_header","data":{"arabic":"إِسْلَامٌ ، قُرْآنٌ ، إِيمَانٌ ← الْإِسْلَامُ ، الْقُرْآنُ ، الْإِيمَانُ","hinglish":"Islam, Qur'an, Imaan → Al-Islam, Al-Qur'an, Al-Imaan (Khaas Ism)","arabic_word":"إِسْلَامٌ ، قُرْآنٌ ، إِيمَانٌ","arabic_combined":"إِسْلَامٌ ، قُرْآنٌ ، إِيمَانٌ ← الْإِسْلَامُ ، الْقُرْآنُ ، الْإِيمَانُ","hinglish_word":"Islam, Qur'an, Imaan","hinglish_combined":"Islam, Qur'an, Imaan → Al-Islam, Al-Qur'an, Al-Imaan (Khaas Ism)","title_en":"Aasaan Qur'ani Alfaaz (Set 1 — Ma'rifah الْـ ki Pehchaan)","subtitle":"Unit 1 • Lesson 1 (Book Page 14–15)","transformations":[{"before_ar":"إِسْلَامٌ ، قُرْآنٌ ، إِيمَانٌ","after_ar":"الْإِسْلَامُ ، الْقُرْآنُ ، الْإِيمَانُ","before_hi":"Islam, Qur'an, Imaan","after_hi":"Al-Islam, Al-Qur'an, Al-Imaan (Khaas Ism)"}]}},{"id":"sec_intro_table","type":"intro_table","data":{"title":"S1L1 — Aasaan Qur'ani Alfaaz (Set 1 — Ma'rifah الْـ ki Pehchaan): Buniyadi Misaalein","caption":"S1L1 — Aasaan Qur'ani Alfaaz (Set 1 — Ma'rifah الْـ ki Pehchaan): Buniyadi Misaalein","headers":["Qism / Qaa'ida","Arabi Misaal","Hinglish Mafhoom"],"rows":[["الْـ + Ism (Khaas Naam)","الْإِسْلَامُ / الْقُرْآنُ / الْإِيمَانُ / الْحَقُّ","Islam / Qur'an / Imaan / Sach (Haq)"],["Deeni Istilahaat","الْحَلَالُ / الْحَرَامُ / الصِّرَاطُ / الْحِسَابُ","Halaal / Haraam / Raasta / Hisaab"],["Kaa'inaat ke Alfaaz","السَّمَاءُ / الْأَرْضُ / الشَّمْسُ / الْقَمَرُ","Aasman / Zameen / Sooraj / Chaand"]]}},{"id":"sec_s1l1_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 1 • LESSON 1</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Aasaan Qur'ani Alfaaz (Set 1 — Ma'rifah الْـ ki Pehchaan) (Page 14–15)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">إِسْلَامٌ ، قُرْآنٌ ، إِيمَانٌ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Al-Ma'rifah (الْـ)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الْإِسْلَامُ ، الْقُرْآنُ ، الْإِيمَانُ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• إِسْلَامٌ ، قُرْآنٌ ، إِيمَانٌ (Islam, Qur'an, Imaan) → الْإِسْلَامُ ، الْقُرْآنُ ، الْإِيمَانُ (Al-Islam, Al-Qur'an, Al-Imaan (Khaas Ism)).</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Unit 1 mein aasaan Qur'ani alfaaz aur buniyadi ishaare/qawa'id sikhaye gaye hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 14–15):** Qur'an Majeed ke hazaron alfaaz Urdu/Hinglish mein pehle hi se ma'roof hain. Arbi mein kisi ism ke shuru mein **`الْـ`** lagane se woh lafz **khaas (*Ma'rifah*)** ho jata hai aur uske aakhri harf par Tanween ke bajaye **ek Pesh (`ـُ`)** aata hai (`الْإِسْلَامُ`، `الْقُرْآنُ`، `الْحَقُّ`)."}},{"id":"sec_s1l1_lbl0","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Qur'an mein baar baar aane wale aasaan alfaaz. Inke matlab samjhein:"}},{"id":"sec_s1l1_g1","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s1l1_g1_w1","arabic":"الْإِسْلَام","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْإِسْلَام</span>","hinglish":"Islam","translations":{"en":"Islam / Submission (to Allah)","ur":"اسلام","hi":"इस्लाम"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w2","arabic":"مُحَمَّدٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مُحَمَّدٌ</span>","hinglish":"Muhammad ﷺ","translations":{"en":"Prophet Muhammad ﷺ","ur":"محمد ﷺ","hi":"मुहम्मद ﷺ"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w3","arabic":"اللهُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">اللهُ</span>","hinglish":"Allah","translations":{"en":"Allah (The One True God)","ur":"اللہ","hi":"अल्लाह"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w4","arabic":"الْجَنَّة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْجَنَّة</span>","hinglish":"Jannat","translations":{"en":"Paradise / The Garden","ur":"جنت","hi":"जन्नत / स्वर्ग"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w5","arabic":"الْكَعْبَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْكَعْبَة</span>","hinglish":"Ka'bah","translations":{"en":"The Ka'bah","ur":"کعبہ","hi":"काबा"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w6","arabic":"الْقُرْآن","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقُرْآن</span>","hinglish":"Qur'an","translations":{"en":"The Quran","ur":"قرآن","hi":"क़ुरआन"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w7","arabic":"الْمُؤْمِن","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمُؤْمِن</span>","hinglish":"Momin","translations":{"en":"The Believer","ur":"مومن","hi":"मोमिन"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w8","arabic":"الْحَرَام","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَرَام</span>","hinglish":"Haram / Na-jaiz","translations":{"en":"The Forbidden / Unlawful","ur":"حرام / ناجائز","hi":"हराम / नाजायज़"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w9","arabic":"الْحَلَال","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَلَال</span>","hinglish":"Halal / Jaiz","translations":{"en":"The Lawful / Permissible","ur":"حلال / جائز","hi":"हलाल / जायज़"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w10","arabic":"الصُّلْح","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الصُّلْح</span>","hinglish":"Sulah","translations":{"en":"Peace / Reconciliation","ur":"صلح","hi":"सुलह / समझौता"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w11","arabic":"الْفَسَاد","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْفَسَاد</span>","hinglish":"Fasad / Kharabi","translations":{"en":"Corruption / Mischief","ur":"فساد / خرابی","hi":"फ़साद / ख़राबी"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w12","arabic":"الْكَافِر","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْكَافِر</span>","hinglish":"Kafir / Inkar karne wala","translations":{"en":"The Disbeliever","ur":"کافر / انکار کرنے والا","hi":"काफ़िर / इनकार करने वाला"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w13","arabic":"اللِّبَاس","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">اللِّبَاس</span>","hinglish":"Libas / Kapda","translations":{"en":"The Clothing / Garment","ur":"لباس / کپڑا","hi":"लिबास / कपड़ा"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w14","arabic":"الْخَالِق","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْخَالِق</span>","hinglish":"Khaliq / Paida karne wala","translations":{"en":"The Creator","ur":"خالق / پیدا کرنے والا","hi":"ख़ालिक़ / पैदा करने वाला"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w15","arabic":"الرَّبّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الرَّبّ</span>","hinglish":"Rabb","translations":{"en":"The Lord / Sustainer","ur":"رب / پالنے والا","hi":"रब / पालनहार"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w16","arabic":"مُوسَىٰ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مُوسَىٰ</span>","hinglish":"Musa (Alaihis Salam)","translations":{"en":"Moses (peace be upon him)","ur":"موسیٰ (علیہ السلام)","hi":"मूसा (अलैहिस्सलाम)"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w17","arabic":"الشَّيْطَان","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الشَّيْطَان</span>","hinglish":"Shaytan","translations":{"en":"Satan / The Devil","ur":"شیطان","hi":"शैतान"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w18","arabic":"الشُّكْر","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الشُّكْر</span>","hinglish":"Shukr","translations":{"en":"Gratitude / Thanks","ur":"شکر","hi":"शुक्र"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w19","arabic":"الْبَاطِل","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَاطِل</span>","hinglish":"Batil / Jhoot","translations":{"en":"Falsehood / The False","ur":"باطل / جھوٹ","hi":"बातिल / झूठ"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w20","arabic":"الْحَقّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَقّ</span>","hinglish":"Haq / Sach","translations":{"en":"The Truth / The Right","ur":"حق / سچ","hi":"हक़ / सच"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w21","arabic":"الطُّوفَان","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الطُّوفَان</span>","hinglish":"Toofan / Sailab","translations":{"en":"The Flood / Deluge","ur":"طوفان / سیلاب","hi":"तूफ़ान / सैलाब"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w22","arabic":"التَّوْبَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">التَّوْبَة</span>","hinglish":"Tauba","translations":{"en":"Repentance","ur":"توبہ","hi":"तौबा"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w23","arabic":"الشِّرْك","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الشِّرْك</span>","hinglish":"Shirk","translations":{"en":"Associating partners (with Allah) / Polytheism","ur":"شرک","hi":"शिर्क"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w24","arabic":"الذِّكْر","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الذِّكْر</span>","hinglish":"Dhikr / Yaad","translations":{"en":"The Remembrance / The Reminder","ur":"ذکر / یاد","hi":"ज़िक्र / याद"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w25","arabic":"الْوَالِد","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْوَالِد</span>","hinglish":"Walid / Baap","translations":{"en":"The Father","ur":"والد / باپ","hi":"वालिद / बाप"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w26","arabic":"الشَّرّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الشَّرّ</span>","hinglish":"Shar / Buraai","translations":{"en":"The Evil / Badness","ur":"شر / برائی","hi":"शर / बुराई"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w27","arabic":"الْخَيْر","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْخَيْر</span>","hinglish":"Khayr / Bhalai","translations":{"en":"The Good / Goodness","ur":"خیر / بھلائی","hi":"ख़ैर / भलाई"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w28","arabic":"الدِّين","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الدِّين</span>","hinglish":"Deen","translations":{"en":"The Religion / Way of life","ur":"دین","hi":"दीन / धर्म"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w29","arabic":"الزَّكَاة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الزَّكَاة</span>","hinglish":"Zakat","translations":{"en":"Zakah / Prescribed charity","ur":"زکوٰۃ","hi":"ज़कात"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w30","arabic":"السُّورَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">السُّورَة</span>","hinglish":"Surah","translations":{"en":"Surah / Chapter","ur":"سورۃ","hi":"सूरह"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w31","arabic":"فِرْعَوْن","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فِرْعَوْن</span>","hinglish":"Fir'awn","translations":{"en":"Pharaoh","ur":"فرعون","hi":"फ़िरऔन"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w32","arabic":"الْجَزَاء","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْجَزَاء</span>","hinglish":"Jaza / Badla","translations":{"en":"Reward / Recompense","ur":"جزا / بدلہ","hi":"जज़ा / बदला"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w33","arabic":"الْحَمْد","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَمْد</span>","hinglish":"Hamd / Tareef","translations":{"en":"All Praise","ur":"حمد / تعریف","hi":"हम्द / तारीफ़"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w34","arabic":"الْمُبَارَك","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمُبَارَك</span>","hinglish":"Mubarak / Ba-barakat","translations":{"en":"The Blessed","ur":"مبارک / با برکت","hi":"मुबारक / बा-बरकत"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w35","arabic":"الْمُقَدَّس","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمُقَدَّس</span>","hinglish":"Muqaddas / Pak","translations":{"en":"The Sacred / Holy","ur":"مقدس / پاک","hi":"मुक़द्दस / पाक"}},{"id":"s1l1_g1_w36","arabic":"الْحَشْر","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَشْر</span>","hinglish":"Hashr / Ikatha hona","translations":{"en":"The Gathering / Resurrection","ur":"حشر / اکٹھا ہونا","hi":"हश्र / इकट्ठा होना"}}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s1l1_r2","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Arabi zaban mein [ اَلْ ] ka matlab 'khaas' (English mein 'The') hota hai, aur yeh un alfaaz ke shuru mein lagta hai jinka mafhoom khaas ('The') ho. Khaas logon ke naamon (maslan: مُحَمَّدٌ, مُوسَىٰ, فِرْعَوْن) ke shuru mein aam taur par [ اَلْ ] nahi aata. Agar iss sabaq ya aane wale asbaaq mein koi naya lafz mile, toh aasaani ke liye use highlight kar lein.","hinglish_text":"Arabi zaban mein [ اَلْ ] ka matlab “yeh” (khaas) hota hai, aur yeh un alfaaz ke shuru mein lagta hai jinka matlab “yeh” ho. Khaas logon ke naamon (maslan: مُحَمَّدٌ, مُوسَىٰ, فِرْعَوْن) ke shuru mein aam taur par [ اَلْ ] nahi aata. Agar iss sabaq ya aane wale asbaaq mein koi naya lafz mile, toh aasaani ke liye use highlight kar lein."}},{"id":"sec_s1l1_lbl3","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Exercise — Safah 15"}},{"id":"sec_s1l1_g4","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s1l1_g4_w1","arabic":"الْفَسَاد","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْفَسَاد</span>","hinglish":"Fasad / Kharabi","translations":{"en":"Corruption / Mischief","ur":"فساد / خرابی","hi":"फ़साद / ख़राबी"}},{"id":"s1l1_g4_w2","arabic":"الْكَافِر","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْكَافِر</span>","hinglish":"Kafir","translations":{"en":"The Disbeliever","ur":"کافر","hi":"काफ़िर"}},{"id":"s1l1_g4_w3","arabic":"الْمُؤْمِن","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمُؤْمِن</span>","hinglish":"Momin","translations":{"en":"The Believer","ur":"مومن","hi":"मोमिन"}},{"id":"s1l1_g4_w4","arabic":"الْحَرَام","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَرَام</span>","hinglish":"Haram","translations":{"en":"The Forbidden / Unlawful","ur":"حرام","hi":"हराम"}},{"id":"s1l1_g4_w5","arabic":"الْحَلَال","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَلَال</span>","hinglish":"Halal","translations":{"en":"The Lawful / Permissible","ur":"حلال","hi":"हलाल"}},{"id":"s1l1_g4_w6","arabic":"اللِّبَاس","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">اللِّبَاس</span>","hinglish":"Libas / Kapda","translations":{"en":"The Clothing / Garment","ur":"لباس / کپڑا","hi":"लिबास / कपड़ा"}},{"id":"s1l1_g4_w7","arabic":"الْخَيْر","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْخَيْر</span>","hinglish":"Khayr / Bhalai","translations":{"en":"The Good / Goodness","ur":"خیر / بھلائی","hi":"ख़ैर / भलाई"}},{"id":"s1l1_g4_w8","arabic":"الْبَاطِل","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَاطِل</span>","hinglish":"Batil / Jhoot","translations":{"en":"Falsehood / The False","ur":"باطل / جھوٹ","hi":"बातिल / झूठ"}},{"id":"s1l1_g4_w9","arabic":"الْحَقّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَقّ</span>","hinglish":"Haq / Sach","translations":{"en":"The Truth / The Right","ur":"حق / سچ","hi":"हक़ / सच"}},{"id":"s1l1_g4_w10","arabic":"فِرْعَوْن","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فِرْعَوْن</span>","hinglish":"Fir'awn","translations":{"en":"Pharaoh","ur":"فرعون","hi":"फ़िरऔन"}},{"id":"s1l1_g4_w11","arabic":"الشِّرْك","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الشِّرْك</span>","hinglish":"Shirk","translations":{"en":"Associating partners (with Allah) / Polytheism","ur":"شرک","hi":"शिर्क"}},{"id":"s1l1_g4_w12","arabic":"مُوسَى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">مُوسَى</span>","hinglish":"Musa (Alaihis Salam)","translations":{"en":"Moses (peace be upon him)","ur":"موسیٰ (علیہ السلام)","hi":"मूसा (अलैहिस्सलाम)"}},