_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْفَسَاد</span>","hinglish":"Fasad","translations":{"en":"Corruption / Mischief","ur":"فساد","hi":"फ़साद"}},{"id":"s1l1_v4_s2","arabic":"الشَّيْطَان","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الشَّيْطَان</span>","hinglish":"Shaytan","translations":{"en":"Satan / The Devil","ur":"شیطان","hi":"शैतान"}},{"id":"s1l1_v4_s3","arabic":"السُّورَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">السُّورَة</span>","hinglish":"Surah","translations":{"en":"Surah / Chapter","ur":"سورۃ","hi":"सूरह"}}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s1l1_vlbl","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Exercise (Page 15 Bottom): Qur'ani Aayaat mein Pehchaane hue Alfaaz (Q-6: 9 Verses)"}},{"id":"sec_s1l1_v4","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s1l1_v4_s4","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"هَذَا حَلَالٌ وَهَذَا حَرَامٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">هَذَا حَلَالٌ وَهَذَا حَرَامٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh halal hai aur yeh haram hai","translations":{"en":"This is lawful and this is unlawful.","ur":"یہ حلال ہے اور یہ حرام ہے","hi":"यह हलाल है और यह हराम है।"},"displayOrder":1,"ref":"16:116"},{"id":"s1l1_v4_s5","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"مُحَمَّدٌ رَسُولُ اللهِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">مُحَمَّدٌ رَسُولُ اللهِ</span>","hinglish":"Muhammad ﷺ Allah ke Rasool hain","translations":{"en":"Muhammad is the Messenger of Allah.","ur":"محمد ﷺ اللہ کے رسول ہیں","hi":"मुहम्मद ﷺ अल्लाह के रसूल हैं।"},"displayOrder":2,"ref":"48:29"},{"id":"s1l1_v4_s6","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"جَعَلَ اللهُ الْكَعْبَةَ الْبَيْتَ الْحَرَامَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">جَعَلَ اللهُ الْكَعْبَةَ الْبَيْتَ الْحَرَامَ</span>","hinglish":"Allah ne Ka'bah ko izzat wala ghar banaya","translations":{"en":"Allah has made the Ka’bah, the Sacred House.","ur":"اللہ نے کعبہ کو حرمت والا گھر بنایا","hi":"अल्लाह ने काबा को इज़्ज़त वाला (पवित्र) घर बनाया।"},"displayOrder":3,"ref":"5:97"},{"id":"s1l1_v4_s7","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"وَالصُّلْحُ خَيْرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَالصُّلْحُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">خَيْرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Aur sulah behtar hai","translations":{"en":"And settlement is best.","ur":"اور صلح بہتر ہے","hi":"और सुलह बेहतर है।"},"displayOrder":4,"ref":"4:128"},{"id":"s1l1_v4_s8","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"إِنَّ الشِّرْكَ لَظُلْمٌ عَظِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّ الشِّرْكَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَظُلْمٌ عَظِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak shirk bada zulm hai","translations":{"en":"Indeed, association [with Allah] is great injustice.","ur":"بیشک شرک بڑا ظلم ہے","hi":"बेशक शिर्क बहुत बड़ा ज़ुल्म है।"},"displayOrder":5,"ref":"31:13"},{"id":"s1l1_v4_s9","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"فَأَخَذَهُمُ الطُّوفَانُ وَهُمْ ظَالِمُونَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَأَخَذَهُمُ الطُّوفَانُ وَهُمْ ظَالِمُونَ</span>","hinglish":"Toh unhen toofan ne pakad liya jabke woh zaalim thay","translations":{"en":"So the flood seized them while they were wrongdoers.","ur":"تو انہیں طوفان نے پکڑ لیا جبکہ وہ ظالم تھے","hi":"तो उन्हें तूफ़ान ने पकड़ लिया जबकि वे ज़ालिम थे।"},"displayOrder":6,"ref":"29:14"},{"id":"s1l1_v4_s10","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"وَإِنَّهُ لِحُبِّ الْخَيْرِ لَشَدِيدٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَإِنَّهُ لِحُبِّ الْخَيْرِ لَشَدِيدٌ</span>","hinglish":"Aur beshak woh bhalai (maal) ki muhabbat mein bohot sakht hai","translations":{"en":"And indeed he is intense in love of wealth.","ur":"اور بیشک وہ مال کی محبت میں بہت سخت ہے","hi":"और बेशक वह भलाई (दौलत) की मोहब्बत में बहुत सख्त है।"},"displayOrder":7,"ref":"100:8"},{"id":"s1l1_v4_s11","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"بِيَدِكَ الْخَيْرُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">بِيَدِكَ الْخَيْرُ</span>","hinglish":"Tere haath mein bhalai hai","translations":{"en":"In Your hand is [all] good.","ur":"تیرے ہی ہاتھ میں بھلائی ہے","hi":"तेरे ही हाथ में भलाई है।"},"displayOrder":8,"ref":"3:26"},{"id":"s1l1_v4_s12","sentence_number":9,"arabic":"إِنَّا نَحْنُ نَزَّلْنَا الذِّكْرَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَحْنُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">نَزَّلْنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الذِّكْرَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak hamne hi iss zikr (Qur'an) ko naazil kiya","translations":{"en":"Indeed, it is We who sent down the Qur'an","ur":"بے شک ہم ہی نے نصیحت (قرآن) کو نازل کیا","hi":"बेशक हम ही ने नसीहत (क़ुरआन) को नाज़िल किया"},"displayOrder":9,"ref":"15:9"}],"cols":3}}]}}